{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B3.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"沉重引子阴冷地回闪，低声荒凉也被短暂划开后迅速退去；亲近似乎确实再现，却已不再郑重，也难以停驻。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.2\", \"B1.3\", \"B2.1\", \"B2.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"声音刚落稳便向高处漂散，同一扇门像从另一面显出；短暂重现的亲近没能变成向前的把握，旧日无措的自己与最初的问题也再次浮起。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B3.1\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"第215小节的短促惊跳把这份未能站稳的感觉骤然点亮，以具体的演奏触感补足这一刻。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"亲近短暂重现又迅速失去支撑，既对应声音落稳即漂散、前进的步伐仍未成形，也使旧日无措的自己与最初的问题再次浮现，却没有得到简单答案。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B3\",\n      \"why\": \"B3.1与B3.2提供的是短促惊跳、荒凉被划开及力量退去等具体的演奏和音响动作；这些动作可以烘托不稳定感，但其具体的音响形态与演奏触感并非这条经历线本身所能解释。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e24353f-d31e-47c1-9af4-0bf90e167316", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084533065839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 183.437, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T08:48:36.506818+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e83c1d3cd9d98933f8961218edd20e5a1dc9ac6b53799942d01e61e3e5752652", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956